<title>AUSTRALIA: Australian meat exports mixed in March 97 - ABS.</title>
<headline>Australian meat exports mixed in March 97 - ABS.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian exports of fresh meat (tonnes) for March 1997 from the Australian Bureau of Statistics.</p>
<p>		   Beef	Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		   Bone-in  Bone-in	 Bone-in     Bone-in</p>
<p> March    97   3,968	54	     7,962	4,500</p>
<p> February 97   3,516	74	     8,946	4,258</p>
<p> March    96   5,643     154	     9,632	4,359</p>
<p>		  Beef	 Veal	   Mutton	Lamb</p>
<p>		  Bone-out   Bone-out     Bone-out    Bone-out</p>
<p> March    97   61,083	248	   4,144	 716</p>
<p> February 97   56,806	337	   4,321	 898</p>
<p> March    96   70,780	324	   5,810	 754</p>
<p>NOTE: Previous month's figures have been revised.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
